  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e02-scene-12",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "また撮れる日を楽しみにしてるんです  (I Look Forward to the Day We Film Again)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "takei": "武井"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Takei warns Kawada that Muranishi's gossip frenzy is about to get all his videos banned from distribution, and late that night in the quiet office Kuroki confides to Kawada that she is still waiting to film with Muranishi again.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "村西さん、テレビ出禁なんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "すいません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "ファンが怒ることで宣伝になるんだからすげえよな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "でもこのままじゃ村西作品はもう流せねえぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうすればいいんでしょうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "びっくりした…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "懐かしいですわね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木君は新作を撮りたいって思わないんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "いつも思ってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督は今は衛星にご執心ですけど、また撮れる日を楽しみにしてるんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "その日は来るんですかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、来ないんじゃないかな。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "村西さん、テレビ出禁なんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hear Muranishi got banned from television, didn't he?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "すいません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "ファンが怒ることで宣伝になるんだからすげえよな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Turning angry fans into free publicity is pretty wild, I'll give him that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "でもこのままじゃ村西作品はもう流せねえぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, if this keeps up, stores won't be allowed to carry Muranishi's films anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうすればいいんでしょうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What should I do to fix this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "びっくりした…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh! You startled me...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "懐かしいですわね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Watching my debut tape brings back fond memories.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木君は新作を撮りたいって思わないんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kuroki, don't you ever feel like shooting a new film?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "いつも思ってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think about it all the time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督は今は衛星にご執心ですけど、また撮れる日を楽しみにしてるんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is absorbed in satellites right now, yet I look forward to the day we film again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "その日は来るんですかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you think that day will really come?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、来ないんじゃないかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Somehow, I have a feeling it won't.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
